  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase">
        AIRPORT INFORMATION & PASSENGER GUIDE
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Cairo International Airport (CAI) & Egypt Airports Overview
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Cairo International Airport (CAI) is the primary aviation hub among all <strong>Egypt airports</strong> and the second busiest gateway in Africa. Situated in historic Heliopolis, approximately 15 kilometers (9 miles) northeast of central Cairo, CAI operates three commercial passenger terminals (<a href="/airports/cairo-airport-terminal-1" class="text-indigo-600 font-bold hover:underline">Terminal 1</a>, <a href="/airports/cairo-airport-terminal-2" class="text-indigo-600 font-bold hover:underline">Terminal 2</a>, and the modern <a href="/airports/cairo-airport-terminal-3" class="text-indigo-600 font-bold hover:underline">Terminal 3</a>) interconnected by a complimentary Automated People Mover (APM) transit train.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Arranging a <strong>transfer from Cairo airport</strong> in advance ensures a seamless transition through the terminal. Once you clear passport control, baggage reclaim, and customs inspection, your chauffeur will be waiting inside the public greeting lounge with your name sign, ready to provide <strong>private Cairo airport transfers</strong> and executive limousine service directly to your destination.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a href="/airports/cairo-international-airport" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 transition">
          <span>Explore Complete Cairo Airport Terminal Guide</span>
